        <mxCell id="LeQyPYB7Y7d7M6lux71_-10" value="&lt;h1 data-end=&quot;352&quot; data-start=&quot;298&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;1. What “accountable &amp;amp; reproducible” means in MLflow&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;398&quot; data-start=&quot;354&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;An MLflow run must answer &lt;strong data-end=&quot;397&quot; data-start=&quot;380&quot;&gt;unambiguously&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol data-end=&quot;600&quot; data-start=&quot;400&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;438&quot; data-start=&quot;400&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;438&quot; data-start=&quot;403&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;438&quot; data-start=&quot;403&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Which seed created this result?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;463&quot; data-start=&quot;439&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;463&quot; data-start=&quot;442&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;463&quot; data-start=&quot;442&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Which data split?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;509&quot; data-start=&quot;464&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;509&quot; data-start=&quot;467&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;509&quot; data-start=&quot;467&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Which preprocessing + sampler + model?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;546&quot; data-start=&quot;510&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;546&quot; data-start=&quot;513&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;546&quot; data-start=&quot;513&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Which features were selected?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;600&quot; data-start=&quot;547&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;600&quot; data-start=&quot;550&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-en